{"id": "65127", "title": "花落谁家好", "author": "非欢欲爱", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65127.htm", "intro": "他说,不允许她离开却自己离开她。\r\n他说,陪她夜夜至天明,她却不想从他身上见著他。\r\n他说,图谋她的心；他喊她落儿,她说你以後都这样喊我,\r\n可她却离开了他们。\r\n他说,我怀了你的孩子,你可不要弃了我,她却失去他的消息。\r\n是谁真心爱她?是谁假情利用她?\r\n究竟她这朵花要落在谁家?", "base": "files/article/html/65/65127", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9694501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9694503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9694506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "9694508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "9694511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9694513.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9694515.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9694517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "9694520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9694523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9694524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9694529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "9694530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "9694531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9694532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9694533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9694534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21完结+番外", "file": "9694535.html", "available": false}]}